{
  "title": "General Aamaal in Rajab",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "First: It is advisable to say the following supplicatory prayer each day in Rajab. It has been narrated that Imam Zayn al-Aabedin (a.s.) used to say this supplicatory prayer on the first day of Rajab while he was imprisoned:\nيَا مَنْ يَمْلِكُ حَوَاۤئِجَ السَّاۤئِلِيْنَ\nYAA MAN YAMLEKO HAWAAA-EJAS SAAA-ELEENA\nO He who manages the wants of the needy, \nوَ يَعْلَمُ ضَمِيْرَ الصَّامِتِيْنَ\nWA YA’LAMO ZAMEERAS SAAMETEENA \nand is aware of that which is hidden in the heart of the silent sufferers! \nلِكُلِّ مَسْاَلَةٍ مِنْكَ سَمْعٌ حَاضِرٌ وَ جَوَابٌ عَتِيْدٌ\nLEKULLE MAS-ALATIN MINKA SAM-U’N HAAZERUN WA JAWAABUN A’TEEDUN\nEvery problem receives Your attention, and is settled well. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ وَ مَوَاعِيْدُكَ الصَّادِقَةُ\nALLAAHUMMA WA MAWAA-E’EDOKAS SAADEQATO\nO Allah, Your promises come true, \nوَ اَيَادِيْكَ الْفَاضِلَةُ\nWA AYAADEEKAL FAAZELATO \nYour favors are many, \nوَ رَحْمَتُكَ الْوَاسِعَةُ\nWA RAHMATOKAL WAASE-A’TO \nand Your Mercy is extensive,\nفَاَسْاَلُكَ اَنْ تُصَلِّيَ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَ اٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nFA-AS-ALOKA AN TOSALLEYA A’LAA MOHAMMADIN WA AALE MOHAMMADIN\ntherefore, I beseech You to send blessings to Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad, \nوَ اَنْ تَقْضِيَ حَوَاۤئِجِيْ لِلدُّنْيَا وَ الْآخِرَةِ\nWA AN TAQZEYA HAWAAA-EJEE LID-DUNYAA WAL AAKHERATE\nand fulfill my desires in this world and in the world to come. \nاِنَّكَ عَلٰى كُلِّ شَيْ‏ءٍ قَدِيرٌ.\nINNAKA A’LAA KULLE SHAY-IN QADEERUN.\nVerily, You have power over all things"
}
